<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Your order has been cancelled
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Confirmation
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  This is a confirmation that your order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> has been cancelled as requested.
</p>
{{#if refund_pending}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  A refund will be processed soon and should appear in your account shortly.
</p>
{{else}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  You will not be charged for this order.
</p>
{{/if}}

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Order number" value=order_number}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Cancelled"}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Changed your mind?"}}
  You can place a new order anytime from your Dukka account. If you did not request this cancellation, reply to this email and we will help right away.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thanks for shopping with Dukka.
</p>
